SeaCavern_Interior1_Text_Trigger2_1::
	.string "JESS: This is weird...\p"
	.string "I don’t understand a single bit\n"
	.string "about this...\p"
	.string "But judging the pictures it seems \n"
	.string "that deep in this cavern there is a\l"
	.string "legendary KEY to awaken a great\l"
	.string "power.\p"
	.string "A power that’s able to cross land\n"
	.string "and time...?$"

SeaCavern_Interior1_Text_Trigger2_2::
	.string "JESS: Now what...\n"
	.string "Oh...$"

SeaCavern_Interior1_Text_Trigger2_3::
	.string "JESS: It’s you again...\p"
	.string "So you want that KEY for that huge\n"
	.string "power?\p"
	.string "No way we’ll let you.\n"
	.string "That power must belong to TEAM\l"
	.string "ROCKET!\p"
	.string "It’s time to settle this, brat!\n"
	.string "because I hate having you around!$"

SeaCavern_Interior1_Text_Trigger2Defeat::
	.string "JESS: We’ve been defeated again!\n"
	.string "JAMIE: Grrr...$"

SeaCavern_Interior1_Text_Trigger2Victory::
	.string "JESS: Yes, we did it!\n"
	.string "JAMIE: That’s Right!$"

SeaCavern_Interior1_Text_Trigger2_4::
	.string "JESS: Why do you have to be in\n"
	.string "our way?\p"
	.string "We just want to rebuild TEAM ROCKET?\n"
	.string "Is something wrong with it?\p"
	.string "But... You’re just a child...\n"
	.string "You wouldn’t understand...\p"
	.string "Let’s blast off JAMIE!$"
